  {
   "i": 0,
   "ch": "OPEN",
   "t0": 0.0,
   "t1": 9.6,
   "note": "hook panel on frame 0; VO 0075 (04:38, leaving home): \"So we are heading to Seattle Washington to go pick up a McLaren 600 LT\""
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "ch": "CH1",
   "t0": 9.6,
   "t1": 17.4,
   "note": "\"at the airport right now as you can see\" / \"a little tired, but we up now\""
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "ch": "CH1",
   "t0": 17.4,
   "t1": 28.6,
   "note": "\"This is our Supercar Experience vlog. We usually transport our vehicles, but I'm driving this one, look at us.\" NAME LOCK"
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "ch": "CH1",
   "t0": 28.6,
   "t1": 33.3,
   "note": "MetaMuse weather: \"it says Seattle's treating you well today\" / \"it says no rain, good day to pick up your McLaren\""
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "ch": "CH1",
   "t0": 33.3,
   "t1": 40.0,
   "note": "\"I'm gonna try to put some animations in this ... make like a flying animation\""
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "ch": "CH1",
   "t0": 40.0,
   "t1": 43.4,
   "note": "\"I'm finally getting on the plane.\""
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "ch": "CH1",
   "t0": 43.4,
   "t1": 48.4,
   "note": "CLOCK STAMP 09:00 IN THE AIR: window shots, engine nat"
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "ch": "CH1",
   "t0": 48.4,
   "t1": 53.8,
   "note": "\"But we finna get in the Uber and I'm finna pick up this car\""
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "ch": "CH2",
   "t0": 53.8,
   "t1": 66.7,
   "note": "CH2 slam over the red shop building; \"How you doing? I'm here to pick up the 600 LT ... from Supercar Experience. I think you guys just put a brand new engine in it. I gotta drive it all the way back to Vegas.\""
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "ch": "CH2",
   "t0": 66.7,
   "t1": 71.9,
   "note": "\"So they got one more hour until they're done with the car.\""
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "ch": "CH2",
   "t0": 71.9,
   "t1": 78.9,
   "note": "\"right now he's finna go grab the 600 LT from the warehouse\""
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "ch": "CH2",
   "t0": 78.9,
